Now study each route separately. Propagation from the openings to the screen has the form $\begin{aligned}
|A\rangle &\longrightarrow \sum_m \psi_m|m\rangle, \\
|B\rangle &\longrightarrow \sum_m \phi_m|m\rangle.\end{aligned}$ The complex number $\psi_m$ is the amplitude to arrive at screen site $m$ after starting at $A$, and $\phi_m$ is the corresponding amplitude after starting at $B$.

